(8. Closing Acknowledgement / Section 8) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 704 Tm
(Both pathways ration information. Control is retained. That is not freedom of) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 688 Tm
(information.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 672 Tm
(The time-volume door \(Mode 1\) and the cost door \(Mode 2\) are not opposite remedies.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 656 Tm
(They are complementary instruments of the same architecture. A denial issued under clock) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 640 Tm
(and volume pressure, and a fee estimate that makes production impossible, are two) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 624 Tm
(receipts for the same withheld record.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 608 Tm
(This acknowledgement is structural, not personal. It does not require a named villain) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 592 Tm
(at a desk. It requires only that the statute as implemented keep the default on the) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 576 Tm
(institution?s side of the door.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 560 Tm
(Lived instance cited by the Zioncheck archive: federal-records requests concerning) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 544 Tm
(surveillance or monitoring of Marion Zioncheck during 1935?1936 appear in Volume IV and) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 528 Tm
(Volume V. The supplied research PDFs contain those requests for records, but no agency) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 512 Tm
(denial letter explaining a present-day refusal. The public ledger on /foia.html is the) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 496 Tm
(place those denial letters, when they exist, are to be hashed and chained.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 480 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 50 464 Tm
(End of citation transcript. For the statute as published by the government, see) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 448 Tm
(https://www.foia.gov/) Tj
